                        <div xml:id="m-f0902e70-223f-43cf-88b3-ecbf6ebc15c0">
                            <lg xml:id="m-17c2ee93-ab81-4e15-8312-4b696e821466">
                                <l xml:id="m-9abc498a-6133-494c-aba6-887df89edcf2" facs="#m-9ffb5bc2-0da5-44cf-92c3-27de488367ac" label="text-like">eth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-a0a4f2a6-1c3d-45ac-8a7a-898fb8a6293f" facs="#m-205ef850-8fee-4c9e-a1c1-e3786e45d04c" label="ambiguous">1007</l><l xml:id="m-e15d3a2c-a53f-4503-9932-ef41e6cc6a10" facs="#m-2f07aed9-cd2d-43bc-8c3d-f5a6c3c0e0cc" label="lyrics-like">scendéntibus in lá-cum. Gló-ri- a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-d469d9d3-be98-4130-ad9a-6bbd8899f2fe" facs="#m-391f7034-c961-436b-a797-f20e17fc6400" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-888b2e45-8bab-47c4-9216-f2ddd6df1f42" facs="#m-9f11081f-7cd0-4347-b0bc-411d32b809a1" label="lyrics-like">Eus virtútum, cujus est totum !augméntum; “ ut quae sunt bona,</l><l xml:id="m-fcaa99ef-40a3-4053-b324-6968ea20807a" facs="#m-6b32b816-e65d-40ff-968c-e772b48c5e86" label="lyrics-like">U quod est óptimum: t insere nútrias, ac pietátis stúdio, quae sunt</l><l xml:id="m-aaaf078e-de65-40f5-8d99-dca89f2bf701" facs="#m-4d576987-9fa2-47f3-92d9-ede3ae5f8c14" label="lyrics-like">pectóribus nostris amórem tui nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-7abd48bb-253a-435a-a3ce-585a982c7572" facs="#m-a9ef97c7-e807-4528-a2fe-0d17c50a3cee" label="lyrics-like">nutrita, custódias. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4c10e75a-930e-4a22-a49d-ee77a03f0891" facs="#m-0b0e2974-aa5d-43b5-a785-23c39c3105d2" label="lyrics-like">minis, et praesta in nobis religiónis</l><l xml:id="m-35c1dcc2-5cdf-494b-923f-cb5a4f08d084" facs="#m-4538a507-b4fc-4948-aad5-91575b09ddaf" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-fb91a240-fceb-4d90-9c44-96432c8a4a24" facs="#m-3fad1e4a-4a93-4f36-aefc-038f689d2954" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Romanos. Rom. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-ea908919-4b41-452e-980f-d66f5b29acf2" facs="#m-044d03c5-f507-4c7e-9ac4-6046dfc03939" label="lyrics-like">Ratres: Quicúmque baptizáti mus peccáto. Qui enim mórtuus est,</l><l xml:id="m-2c02e341-d0ae-424d-99aa-5b65e2b8ed87" facs="#m-2d8ea4ab-e2f5-4351-9557-01df97dd3a16" label="lyrics-like">sumus in Christo Jesu, in morte justificátus est a peccáto. Si autem</l><l xml:id="m-4240108e-be25-4d56-b04f-5412947245cd" facs="#m-475fe26e-d9f9-4178-ae7a-14b6f2402891" label="lyrics-like">ipsius baptizáti sumus. Consepúlti</l><l xml:id="m-44367ca3-a1bb-4d34-bc87-a74cf4eac31c" facs="#m-74a90d72-cbf0-4893-859c-ab46c46c25fd" label="lyrics-like">mórtui sumus cum Christo: crédi¬</l><l xml:id="m-27ed389c-97cc-442f-9fdf-6cddbfc9fc4a" facs="#m-dee64b52-96fa-4c94-b90d-b5d111661731" label="lyrics-like">mus quia simul étiam vivémus cum</l><l xml:id="m-d4b60d7c-3794-4c02-90cb-8ffa9fae5359" facs="#m-4e0aabe3-0e33-42d2-9e28-6b623b93de2d" label="lyrics-like">enim sumus cum illo per baptísmum</l><l xml:id="m-6562635f-3076-42f2-a88c-816881ade3df" facs="#m-6b87919a-5e1c-45ca-99ca-e256743d862d" label="lyrics-like">Christo: sciéntes quod Christus re¬</l><l xml:id="m-d608f954-c7ab-4f5b-8558-d9800c49d118" facs="#m-45661755-e580-4e21-a573-5f65bc648316" label="lyrics-like">in mortem: ut quómodo Christus</l><l xml:id="m-42e8a4a4-e09f-4f85-a0e2-ac714f830045" facs="#m-de1589ec-ff6f-4f39-9342-1cb66e6c694a" label="lyrics-like">surréxit a mórtuis per glóriam Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-eaa5b2bd-b064-48b3-93bb-a2f0467dff55" facs="#m-448a20a4-ddb9-430f-a1af-4ba1701e35bb" label="lyrics-like">súrgens ex mórtuis, iam non móri¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb1d82f9-329a-48b9-8194-d1c696309328" facs="#m-2eddf027-6fd4-4230-b37d-1394c8d2c097" label="lyrics-like">tris, ita et nos in novitáte vitae</l><l xml:id="m-0ee48e58-17d3-41b1-9e25-f7de74708e4e" facs="#m-a00bb2a6-b22f-4458-9ceb-b21891f0c4b6" label="lyrics-like">tur, mors illi ultra non dominábi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6a717284-5245-4e94-a817-d8eba8e9dce9" facs="#m-5fb0438a-645a-454c-abde-ee384744a0ed" label="lyrics-like">ambulémus. Si enim complantáti</l><l xml:id="m-e8707905-91cf-47eb-ace7-fd64d9782732" facs="#m-2ac24eaa-9bf4-4db5-b41a-05bf3ad54e80" label="lyrics-like">tur. Quod enim mórtuus est peccáto,</l><l xml:id="m-58554309-26cf-420d-9c0c-19d62b98f1b7" facs="#m-1c51a443-38a6-4d25-8230-604ee0c7d328" label="lyrics-like">facti sumus similitúdini mortis eius:</l><l xml:id="m-32751fee-3cd8-4a9c-87ee-93fc2dae844b" facs="#m-4c284b3e-ba5a-4831-9e35-353715797bca" label="lyrics-like">mórtuus est semel: quod autem</l><l xml:id="m-8296d98b-15d3-40f3-acc1-a48c2a48ac48" facs="#m-13118449-98fe-4e95-9a8d-8581a3869ae4" label="lyrics-like">simul et resurrectiónis érimus. Hoc</l><l xml:id="m-253505c1-f765-4de1-8aa4-ca27c3187aee" facs="#m-9dd3c59d-9c32-480e-8b2d-3ec81f1453d6" label="ambiguous">vivit, vivit Deo. Ita et vos existi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8dcb8de-5d8e-4840-a7c7-a7f5a43fa3db" facs="#m-7a2f8261-6d5d-46c8-924e-539a887c4828" label="lyrics-like">sciéntes, quia vetus homo noster si¬</l><l xml:id="m-212b514b-cc60-4580-8c69-cb7068c813dd" facs="#m-0665e718-c5be-4969-b614-d2e0f2fc92b6" label="lyrics-like">máte, vos mórtuos quidem esse pec¬</l><l xml:id="m-9345ed08-8ef5-4ac9-97fa-73099a3e1a68" facs="#m-518b211d-ac52-441d-800f-2afe4515cb3d" label="lyrics-like">mul crucifixus est: ut destruátur l cáto, vivéntes autem Deo, in Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d540396-21b5-4c03-8348-d80e8d7d14b0" facs="#m-51370350-e395-4fec-9bf5-843facd92a20" label="lyrics-like">corpus peccáti, et ultra non serviá- sto Jesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-0e191312-3250-477c-9e6d-47fbc1145afe" facs="#m-88758c05-f6e5-43b7-9b02-5bb5f485e94d" label="ambiguous">Grad.E</l><l xml:id="m-366cad1e-106c-4547-9023-90ca1cdbf4cd" facs="#m-24e41878-08c7-40b1-9510-befdb7fc1e24" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-0297a517-fe7b-47f1-92f4-1abc845e30a8" facs="#m-182bafe4-41c1-41c1-8a7c-b4f46b8eb729" label="lyrics-like">Onvér- te-re “Dó- mi-ne</l><l xml:id="m-9b52f318-6e39-477b-9b53-9b378aa32c9c" facs="#m-3ad130a3-f0e4-4c6f-9226-4733bafabf75" label="lyrics-like">a-liquántu¬</l><l xml:id="m-d94df9ca-4c82-4f1c-b7fa-df82cc147361" facs="#m-701da72c-586c-4a9b-ab34-f9707e2a5a95" label="ambiguous">lum,</l><l xml:id="m-1088ac77-0c4e-468e-ae30-79ddb67ded36" facs="#m-286860ae-384e-4335-923c-f050f3a956e5" label="lyrics-like">et depre-cá¬ re</l><l xml:id="m-c16747c2-23c0-404e-9d53-ea8a755ad5a3" facs="#m-0928a6f1-9a50-489d-9be3-5ae68074c33e" label="lyrics-like">super sér-vos tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-61cc3ce2-3ab6-4ff7-a8a1-59aeca3abf60" facs="#m-6a683ed8-b086-4994-8d0e-f0645241425a" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómi-ne</l><l xml:id="m-e3cb5f97-1d17-430e-bcd0-7e1e2d56764f" facs="#m-aed3e954-55db-4381-87b7-b43308dbc0cb" label="ambiguous">bis, a gene¬</l><l xml:id="m-61bb5a95-4baa-44fc-a4d0-4381262073f1" facs="#m-5dd9f853-c11d-49df-b173-d88facd32855" label="lyrics-like">re-fú¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8aae7a1-7e0d-497e-a6a5-4ace37192967" facs="#m-272658ac-cfb3-4ba2-a765-e11bd0b24ec0" label="lyrics-like">um fáctus es nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-93b89474-b3a6-4d17-8978-2f012e216669" facs="#m-b6910478-7817-4525-973c-52557ed9446e" label="ambiguous">gi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a1b7c36b-0c47-4979-a1c6-b1c4f3a32bbc" facs="#m-73713920-92e0-4be4-8861-bcaf5d8e34f4" label="ambiguous">ni-e.</l><l xml:id="m-6ff9c5a1-ceda-48cc-896a-bbd664dceffd" facs="#m-ef7bb44d-7416-4830-9674-f1a787f9f694" label="lyrics-like">ra-ti-6- ne “ et progé¬</l></lg>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </score>
            </mdiv>
        </body>
    </music>
</mei>